00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:19.540
It feels clean.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:20.920
It also feels moisturized.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:24.040
But after I do use that bar, I go back and use

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:27.760
Ms. V's Purifying Toner just to put it on my face,

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.960
make sure everything is all one tone.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.280
and I like it.

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.760
Her truth bar is definitely the truth bar.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:35.840
So thank you, Ms. Vonetta.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.440
You brought my skin back to life.
